WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.621
Row Rumble is a card game where the goal is to collect as little as possible.

2
00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:10.017
It's for two to ten players, and you can play it against the computer too.

3
00:00:10.717 --> 00:00:18.947
Everyone holds ten cards numbered from one to a hundred and four. Four rows sit on the table, each starting with a single card.

4
00:00:19.648 --> 00:00:24.722
Each turn, everyone secretly picks a card, and then they're all revealed at once.

5
00:00:24.872 --> 00:00:30.821
Starting with the lowest number, each card goes onto the row whose last card is closest below it.

6
00:00:31.521 --> 00:00:41.745
Here's the catch. A row only holds five cards. If yours would be the sixth, you have to take the whole row, and every bull head on those cards counts against you.

7
00:00:41.895 --> 00:00:46.184
And if your card is lower than every row, you get to choose a row to take.

8
00:00:46.884 --> 00:00:54.520
So low cards are risky early on, and high cards get risky late. Watch how full each row is before you decide.

9
00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:00.448
When someone reaches sixty-six bull heads the game ends, and the person with the fewest wins.
